{"type":"text","timestamp":1786359376988,"sessionID":"ses_014af9edcffeTMSZKanchQe4CG","part":{"id":"prt_feb50e372001lLwbRI59F2I4QT","messageID":"msg_feb50dad40013QPd1AOCYaqMVc","sessionID":"ses_014af9edcffeTMSZKanchQe4CG","type":"text","text":"捷克共和国（Country='CZE'）加油站的交易涉及的产品描述（去重后共 21 种）：\nNafta、Provoz.nápl.、Natural、Nemrz.kapal.、Oleje,tuky、Diesel +、LPG、Mytí vozidel、Autokosmet.、Potraviny、Nafta Plus、Natural Spec、Zpr.nakupu、Autoprísluš.、Natural +、Dalnic.popl.、Knihy,nov.、Zboží nesp.、Obcerstvení、Additivum、Natural Plus\n\n数据来源：`er_semantic_query`（定位 debit_card_specializing 库）→ `get_entity_mapping`（transactions_1k/gasstations/products 表结构）→ `er_search_evidence`（确认按 GasStationID JOIN gasstations 获取 Country）→ `execute_sql`。\n\nFinal Answer: Nafta, Provoz.nápl., Natural, Nemrz.kapal., Oleje,tuky, Diesel +, LPG, Mytí vozidel, Autokosmet., Potraviny, Nafta Plus, Natural Spec, Zpr.nakupu, Autoprísluš., Natural +, Dalnic.popl., Knihy,nov., Zboží nesp., Obcerstvení, Additivum, Natural Plus\nEvidence SQL: SELECT DISTINCT p.Description FROM transactions_1k t JOIN gasstations g ON t.GasStationID = g.GasStationID JOIN products p ON t.ProductID = p.ProductID WHERE g.Country = 'CZE'","time":{"start":1786359374706,"end":1786359376975}}}
